Package: GiottoConnect
Type: Package
Title: Giotto Interoperability and External Tool Connections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Giotto Suite Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "giottosuite@gmail.com")
Description: A hub for Giotto interoperability functions and connections to
    external single-cell, spatial, and visualization frameworks. Bundles
    conversions between Giotto and Seurat, SingleCellExperiment,
    SpatialExperiment, AnnData, SpatialData, Bento, and Stereo-seq GEF, plus
    a Vitessce viewer pipeline that converts a Giotto spatial single-cell
    object into a static Vitessce-powered website deployable via GitHub Pages.
